      "content": "but it is different for me though. they didn't just move for a \"chance\", they gave up their whole lives. their whole identity. and i'm just wasting it. every time i see them so proud of what they think i'm doing, it feels like i'm lying to them. i feel like the more i try to fix it, the more i just make the shame worse. it's like i'm just dragging their legacy down with me.",
